# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository AND in the working tree, on every OS.
# This project is built on Windows and macOS; without this, a Windows editor or tool that
# writes CRLF turns a 5-line change into a whole-file diff and makes merges unreviewable.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Things that must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.pptx binary
*.woff2 binary
